 ## <a name="2.5.1" />[2.5.1] - Unreleased
 
+### Fixed
+
+* Forward MSBuild application metadata, test failures and run summaries through the controller when TRX or another extension restarts the test host. Keep the outer build pipe in the controller, authorize the child relay for the exact sandbox identity, and preserve in-process runs that need no controller.
